8572960_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LIPAl_FdC3YQ7kNvwFnO2cg&_nc_oc=Adm5xmDDEnOvsJzXv1k_5XIymW_HbLVGO8hxPMGKAx93XzRNFNG0Hf0wNN5uGeJlC9s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz9tJZNEiWFLBeXHl2d0InLTw7_UXXzDaAL90Cgw2GRSA&oe=69BA8B53"}, {"file_name": "11.png", "id": "202399036020094", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031388_202399039353427_6680448244751197845_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IZPSQLmuZOAQ7kNvwE4OC0C&_nc_oc=AdnxxRGQjiAaVYSdJF2BRinDuFRP9pw3Fezg_mfqbbQhscHp3nXMz_IP1ScI5chDn_0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzgLPjjPKF2i3px-LSbN_ws2CylqEe5UsUC8W5QQSIITA&oe=69BAB978"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "869881297890515", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001727_869881301223848_4956483551034422676_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jFJQrhpffygQ7kNvwFltG9U&_nc_oc=Adla5mxV_y1PtGvg_nE4fZM3GMlIMY-vs60FyqS4M81KlgDd4MGTWHq17Xq87vK_FLY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzkVX93CngEgWMPzx67WvZFpcqtIiWgau0M28_5lf49mA&oe=69BA8FDD"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1029913311618453", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75280177_1029913314951786_1716028478303834469_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3QjBfbi4L9MQ7kNvwGKYALV&_nc_oc=AdnIbDzpLs8Kx1y9UDMkZHoSYZ9xc_HKfQuQSfOldI8mIckJhQGwz_UQfr27yKSKePM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzJmOP17oNbBcZxasNi4LP1IeJU4RJPyWZGge6qO7C3Mw&oe=69BA9224"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Mini Games", "keywords": ["mini", "games", "puzzle", "casual", "table"], "long_description": "A collection of seated mini games including:\n\nRail Targets: Hit the targets, while riding in a rail carriage.\n\nPiece Puzzle: Connect the pieces of an object to complete the puzzle.\n\nUnblock The Road: Slide the blocks to connect the road.\n\nMinesweeper: Find all the mines and clear the grid.\n\nShell Game: Pick which cup the ball is in, after the cups have been moved around.\n\nKlondike Solitaire: The classic game of Klondike using playing cards.\n\nPyramid Solitaire: The classic card game where you have to find pairs that add up to 13.\n\nSpider Solitaire: A popular variation of solitaire with the option to play with either 1 suit or 2 suits, for increased difficulty.\n\nJigsaw Puzzle: Choose a picture and complete the puzzle.\n\nChess: The classic game of chess.\n\nCheckers: The classic game of checkers.\n\nWhack A Mole: Hit as many moles as you can, as fast as you can.\n\nWire Loop Game: Move the hoop along the wire, within the time limit.\n\nShooting Gallery: Get as many points as you can, by shooting the objects.\n\nMarble Solitaire: Complete the game by removing all the balls, but one, from the board.\n\nCarnival Rail: Throw baseballs and hoops at the carnival style targets, while riding in a rail carriage.", "short_description": "A collection of seated mini games:\n\nRail Targets: Hit the targets riding a carriage.\nPiece Puzzle: Connect the pieces.\nUnblock The Road: Slide the blocks.\nMinesweeper\nShell Game: Which cup is the ball in?\nKlondike Solitaire\nPyramid Solitaire\nSpider Solitaire\nJigsaw Puzzle: Complete the puzzle.\nChess\nCheckers\nWhack A Mole\nWire Loop Game: Move the hoop along the wire.\nShooting Gallery: Get as many points as you can.\nMarble Solitaire\nCarnival Rail: Throw baseballs and hoops, riding in a carriage."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://mobilefusionapps.com/privacypolicyvr.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MobileFusion Apps LTD", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://mobilefusionapps.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": 